Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:41:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] FXL-1: split pasted log into messages and parse fields

- src/framing.js: splitMessages(text) detects SOH/pipe delimiters per message,
  finds 8=FIX starts (not inside field values), terminates on tag 10 with 3 digits,
  and returns candidates with number, start, and fields (tag/value/offset).
- test/helpers/fix.js: buildMessage(fields, {delim}) computes BodyLength (tag 9)
  and CheckSum (tag 10) per FIX spec.
- test/framing.test.js: 14 tests covering all 8 acceptance criteria.
- test/helpers.test.js: 7 tests for the helper.
